            "notes": "# Powers\n## Recommend\n[Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3)\nIf you're sure, that you can play pretty active and do not die if you're playing with your dps. The Inspire triggered by the Bash is really good!\n\n## Optional\n[Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753)\nThis is a secondary choice for me, because it is more passive to play more safe against flying heroes\n\n\n# Items\n## Recommend\n* [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) \n* [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) \n* [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)\n\n## Optional\n* [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)",
